    "en": {
      "trackName": "MotoRace: Oncoming Fury",
      "description": "MotoRace: Oncoming Fury is an adrenaline-pumping and fast-paced arcade-style game where players take control of a powerful motorbike and must navigate a treacherous highway filled with oncoming cars. The goal is to survive as long as possible while dodging the relentless traffic.\n\nAvailable for watch, phone and tablet. \n\nFeatures: \n- Endless levels\n- Playable without internet connection (play offline)\n- Cool retro graphics\n- Survive as long as you can!\n- More games inside you can unlock",
      "releaseNotes": "More content added",
